<title>GERMANY: Bayer details profits/sales by region.</title>
<headline>Bayer details profits/sales by region.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales:				48,608   vs 44,580</p>
<p>Of which --</p>
<p>	 Polymers				  14,771  vs 13,165</p>
<p>	 Chemicals				 9,579   vs 9,231</p>
<p>	 Health care			     11,825  vs 11,103</p>
<p>	 Agriculture			     4,965   vs 4,544</p>
<p>	 Agfa group				7,468   vs 6,537</p>
<p>	 Income from operations:</p>
<p>	 Polymers				  1,494   vs 973</p>
<p>	 Chemicals				 84	vs 391</p>
<p>	 Health care			     1,869   vs 1,825</p>
<p>	 Agriculture			     820     vs 717</p>
<p>	 Agfa group				243     vs 205</p>
<p>Sales by regions: (by point of origin)</p>
<p>	 Europe				    27,815  vs 26,630</p>
<p>	 North America			   12,192  vs 10,006</p>
<p>	 Latin America			   2,865   vs 2,414</p>
<p>	 Asia/Africa/Australia		 5,736   vs 5,530</p>
<p>Income from operations:</p>
<p>	 Europe				    2,918   vs 2,623</p>
<p>	 North America			   1,002   vs 951</p>
<p>	 Latin America			   248     vs 186</p>
<p>	 Asia/Africa/Australia		 342     vs 351</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German chemicals and pharmaceuticals company is Bayer AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
